# Schema lint allowlist — accepted exceptions to the schema conventions.
# Format: Model.field:rule  (or  Model:rule  for model-level rules)
#
# When a table is migrated to compliance, REMOVE its entries from this file.
# Convention in .claude/skills/backend-patterns/id-convention.md
#
# tenant-scoping-missing entries are tables scoped through a parent row (a user,
# a subscription, a conversation) or platform-wide by design. PasswordResetToken
# and WhatsAppConsent belong to a person, not a tenant.

AddOn.id:no-cuid
AddOn:tenant-scoping-missing
Announcement:tenant-scoping-missing
ApiKey:tenant-scoping-missing
BillingCustomer.id:no-cuid
BillingInvoice.id:no-cuid
BillingInvoice.periodEnd:datetime-suffix
BillingInvoice.periodStart:datetime-suffix
BillingSubscription.currentPeriodEnd:datetime-suffix
